cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'CCA: Convergent Context Architecture'
message: 'If you use CCA, please cite it using the metadata below.'
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jonathan
    family-names: Di Rico
repository-code: 'https://github.com/yonasuriv/CCA'
url: 'https://github.com/yonasuriv/CCA'
abstract: >-
  CCA is an agent-agnostic interoperability layer for
  filesystem-native AI context, designed to make ICM
  workspaces, LLM Wikis, AGENTS.md, Agent Skills, and
  existing projects work together without forcing a new
  convention. It provides shared structure, routing, skills,
  and compatibility rules so context remains portable across
  agents, tools, and runtimes.
keywords:
